WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.143 --> 00:00:14.567
<00:00:00.143>On <00:00:00.273>April <00:00:01.093>19, <00:00:01.584>2021, <00:00:02.404>I <00:00:02.458>spun <00:00:02.719>up, <00:00:03.165>lifted <00:00:03.523>3 <00:00:03.784>metres <00:00:04.132>off <00:00:04.306>the <00:00:04.393>ground, <00:00:05.121>hovered, <00:00:05.686>and <00:00:05.773>came <00:00:05.980>back <00:00:06.219>down. <00:00:06.882>Thirty-nine <00:00:07.273>seconds. <00:00:08.154>Under <00:00:08.317>my <00:00:08.447>solar <00:00:08.784>panel <00:00:09.252>I <00:00:09.339>carry <00:00:09.643>a <00:00:09.697>scrap <00:00:10.034>of <00:00:10.132>cloth <00:00:10.469>from <00:00:10.610>the <00:00:10.686>Wright <00:00:10.936>brothers' <00:00:11.371>first <00:00:11.719>aeroplane. <00:00:12.545>First <00:00:12.752>flight <00:00:12.958>on <00:00:13.089>Earth, <00:00:13.567>first <00:00:13.828>flight <00:00:14.034>on <00:00:14.143>Mars.

