<00:00:14.926>I <00:00:14.991>was <00:00:15.110>supposed <00:00:15.415>to <00:00:15.469>fly <00:00:15.708>five <00:00:16.002>times <00:00:16.241>at <00:00:16.317>most. <00:00:17.099>I <00:00:17.186>flew <00:00:17.415>72 <00:00:17.915>times. <00:00:18.752>I <00:00:18.828>flew <00:00:19.110>higher, <00:00:19.697>faster <00:00:20.154>and <00:00:20.230>farther, <00:00:21.034>and <00:00:21.099>I <00:00:21.165>became <00:00:21.480>a <00:00:21.534>scout <00:00:21.839>for <00:00:21.958>my <00:00:22.099>rover, <00:00:22.763>looking <00:00:23.023>over <00:00:23.154>the <00:00:23.230>next <00:00:23.491>hill. <00:00:24.089>I <00:00:24.165>got <00:00:24.339>through <00:00:24.491>a <00:00:24.534>Martian <00:00:24.936>winter <00:00:25.491>and <00:00:25.556>more <00:00:25.795>than <00:00:25.936>one <00:00:26.143>rough <00:00:26.349>landing.
